<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FIRMS TO 12.05 FROM 12.03 PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FIRMS TO 12.05 FROM 12.03 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month rose to 12.05 from 12.03 percent and the</p>
<p>bid rate (Athibid) increased to 11.58 from 11.56 percent.</p>
